# Deployment

- Single Worker: `wrangler deploy` from `apps/web` only
- Staging: push `develop` → `--env staging`
- Production: tag `v*` → `--env production`
- Never use Cloudflare Pages or `wrangler pages deploy`
- Secrets via `npm run secrets:sync:*` / `.dev.vars` locally — never commit
- Required Worker secrets: `DATABASE_URL`, `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` (+ optional `R2_*`)
- After schema changes: migrate + seed each Neon branch (`0001_better_auth`, `0002_analytics`)
